      "locator": "html:paragraph[1]",
      "text": "Latest Commodity Prices Published"
    },
    {
      "locator": "html:paragraph[2]",
      "text": "(08/04/2026). The energy price index eased 1.1% in July, weighed down by declines in coal (-4.8%) and crude oil (-2.2%), partly offset by a 19.1% surge in European natural gas prices. The non-energy index remained broadly stable (+0.3%). Food prices changed little (-0.3%), fertilizers declined 4.3%, beverage prices rose 17.4%, while raw materials slipped 0.5%. Metals fell 2.8%, and precious metals retreated 5.2%."
    },
    {
      "locator": "html:paragraph[3]",
      "text": "Next update: September 2, 2026."
    }
  ],
